        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset TNL, Simple Tustin Scroll Leverset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nKwikset's Tustin Door Leverset is a reversible lever with a stylish wave silhouette design. This beautiful design is adaptable and thus will look at home amongst almost any decor--be it contemporary, traditional, or any style in between. The TNL Tustin Lever fits most pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" for door 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Kwikset Tustin Door Lever Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick 6 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed levers (except half dummy function).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the TNL Tustin Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Lever Projection: 2-19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior lever engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior lever. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Half Dummy Levers are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Tustin Lever functions are non-handed.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Tustin Door Lever Set, Kwikset TNL",
                "description": "Kwikset TNL Tustin Door Lever - Kwikset's Tustin Door Leverset is a reversible lever with a stylish wave silhouette design. This beautiful design is adaptable and thus will look at home amongst almost any decor--be it contemporary, traditional, or any style in between. The TNL Tustin Lever fits most pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.",
                "keywords": "KWI-TNL, Kwikset Tustin Levers, kwikset Signature Series levers,  kwikset 788TNL dummy Levers, kwikset 720TNL passage Levers, kwikset 730TNL privacy Levers, kwikset 740TNL keyed entry Levers, levers for doors, Tustin door lever sets, keyed door Lever locks, Kwikset door locks, Tustin Stylish Wave Lever sets, classic door levers, traditional door levers, simple leversets,"
